WEBVTT

01:04:29.756 --> 01:04:32.021
I'm Chris Anderson, thanks for listening.

01:04:40.738 --> 01:04:42.063
On our next episode,

01:04:42.087 --> 01:04:45.325
one of the world's most famous
introverts, Susan Cain.

01:04:45.349 --> 01:04:47.825
We talk about the science of introversion,

01:04:47.849 --> 01:04:50.127
and how the world could be so much better

01:04:50.151 --> 01:04:53.301
for introverts, and extroverts,
for that matter --

01:04:53.325 --> 01:04:56.896
at work, at school,
and in our personal relationships.

01:04:57.214 --> 01:04:59.920
Susan Cain: One place
that the difference shows up for us

01:04:59.944 --> 01:05:01.849
in a way that you might not think about